<div id="text-6d5190a07b" class="cmp-text">
    <h2>Topic-Specific Methodology</h2>
<p><i>Women, Business and the Law</i> topics examine laws, policies, and enforcement across 10 key areas shaping women’s economic opportunities throughout their lives.</p>
<p><b>Select a topic below to explore the methodology in details.</b></p>

</div>

    


	
    
