<div id="text-705a34140c" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>Parameters</b>:</p>
<p>For the Pay topic, the <i>Women, Business and the Law</i> methodology assumes a woman residing in the economy’s main business city. Unless otherwise specified, the woman is assumed to be a lawful citizen who has reached the legal age of majority, is in good health, has no criminal record, and is capable of making independent decisions as an adult.</p>

</div>

    


	
    


 
</div>
